1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:01,725
OK, sure.

2
00:00:01,726 --> 00:00:05,545
So... we had problems with how we recruited and trained
the navigators.

3
00:00:05,545 --> 00:00:08,541
The training wasn't deep enough for what we were asking
people to do.

4
00:00:09,741 --> 00:00:14,907
We ended up losing trust with two of our partner clinics
over it, because they felt like we'd sent people into

5
00:00:14,907 --> 00:00:17,171
their spaces who weren't ready.

6
00:00:17,171 --> 00:00:19,308
I think the model can definitely work.

7
00:00:19,308 --> 00:00:21,768
But you need to know that this history exists.

